{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terraform barren worlds in your assigned galactic sector of 1,000,000 star systems. Each star system contains two (2) unique FLOWorld puzzles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Moon (easier)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Planet (harder)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FLOWorlds is a relaxing &quot;coffee game&quot;. Expect to terraform a Moon during a coffee break, or a Planet on a lunch break.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stop and resume at any time, game state is saved on exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No locked worlds. Unlimited travel to any star system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay worlds to improve ice-cluster resource usage efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No in-app purchases or ads.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The games starmap is based on a subset of the Gaia Catalogue of Nearby Stars. Credit and thanks to ESA/Gaia/DPAC for the data.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475750?t=1749474684","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475750/64e32c34e9c99754a4bba6eee42d83c22be221d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749474684","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475750/a05558bb9cd109515f49dd0db85a4cb5caa61c2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749474684","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475750/a05558bb9cd109515f49dd0db85a4cb5caa61c2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749474684","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terraform barren worlds in your assigned galactic sector of 1,000,000 star systems. Each star system contains two (2) unique FLOWorld puzzles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Moon (easier)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Planet (harder)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FLOWorlds is a relaxing &quot;coffee game&quot;. Expect to terraform a Moon during a coffee break, or a Planet on a lunch break.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stop and resume at any time, game state is saved on exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No locked worlds. Unlimited travel to any star system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay worlds to improve ice-cluster resource usage efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No in-app purchases or ads.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The games starmap is based on a subset of the Gaia Catalogue of Nearby Stars. Credit and thanks to ESA/Gaia/DPAC for the data.</p>","developers":["Galvanized Logic Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475750/3c71a04738d84d74fb354f077b2a15db38990172/header.jpg?t=1749474684","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107779,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107779/movie480.mp4?t=1747830054","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107779/movie_max.mp4?t=1747830054"},"name":"FLOWorlds Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107779/f34b69f92b3d549c651e0eec08e57314698cd024/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747830054","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107779/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747830054","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com